│ patch_description        │ This version reorganizes the program into a small feature-engineering pipeline with       │
│                          │ reusable helpers instead of one long monolithic block. The feature set is redesigned      │
│                          │ around shorter rolling windows, rolling z-score normalization, and regime-change signals  │
│                          │ so the model is less dependent on brittle absolute levels and more sensitive to recent    │
│                          │ market structure.                                                                         │
│                          │                                                                                           │
│                          │ Key structural changes:                                                                   │
│                          │ - Feature generation is split into modular helpers for returns, volatility, momentum,     │
│                          │ regime trends, and normalized interactions.                                               │
│                          │ - Most features use shorter lookbacks and rolling normalization to improve regime         │
│                          │ transfer.                                                                                 │
│                          │ - Added compact rate-of-change features for volatility, autocorrelation, efficiency, and  │
│                          │ volume pressure.                                                                          │
│                          │ - Introduced a small set of multiplicative interactions that combine momentum with regime │
│                          │ state.                                                                                    │
│                          │ - Reduced model complexity and added regularization to improve validation stability and   │
│                          │ preserve prediction variance.                                                             │
│                          │                                                                                           │
│                          │ The external interface is unchanged: `build_features()` still only uses past data, and    │
│                          │ `run_experiment()` returns the same outputs in the same format.                           │
